msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus documentation\nLanguage: en\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: ee0299e0311ebba7fd1699711166613273933ce2208369071bd75104a277b24e\n"

msgid "当前派生能力矩阵"
msgstr "Current derived capability matrix"

msgid "本表由维护工具读取当前 F4 事实、受审路线、四个 Board 包、实际软件装配和生成 face 对应的生产 ops 定义生成。它不是另一份配置输入，也不建立编译、执行或实板 资格。声明模式、允许 route 和本次选择分别核对，空列表示没有该类关联。"
msgstr "The maintenance tool derives this table from current F4 facts, reviewed routes, four Board packages, actual software assemblies and production ops definitions associated with generated faces. It is not another configuration input and establishes no compile, execution or physical-board qualification. Check declared modes, allowed routes and current selections separately; an empty column means no association of that kind."

msgid "生产聚合只包含 `stm32f4`。Native 属于显式 host-test scope，不计入生产 SoC 支持； 其他保留的 vendor SDK 不进入本表。精确限制见[支持](support.md)。"
msgstr "Production aggregation contains only `stm32f4`. Native belongs to explicit host-test scope and does not count as production SoC support. Other retained vendor SDKs do not enter this table. See [support](support.md) for exact limitations."

msgid "从完整仓库根执行，工具按同一原始事实重建表；`--check` 拒绝陈旧内容。修改能力应 先改真实实现、事实与合同回归，再生成此投影，不手工编辑表格行。"
msgstr "Run from the complete repository root. The tool rebuilds the table from the same original facts; `--check` rejects stale output. Change real implementations, facts and contract regressions first, then regenerate this projection rather than editing rows manually."

msgid "查询与证据"
msgstr "Queries and evidence"

msgid "选择查询报告精确型号、Board、模式、资源、预算和输入身份，不运行新的编译、测试、 烧录或测量。默认软件阶段保留 `not_assessed`，不表示历史上从未执行，也不表示失败。"
msgstr "Selection queries report exact parts, Board, modes, resources, budgets and input identity. They do not run a new compilation, test, flash or measurement. The default software stage remains `not_assessed`, which means neither never executed historically nor failed."

msgid "显式引用原候选或阶段记录时，核对其真实来源、配置、产物和执行 scope；历史源码、 配置不匹配、缺少原件与无效记录不能升级成本次通过。SDK 字节身份、实际消费与完整 软件候选也是不同范围。使用 manifest 输入的 SDK 解析可能与 checkout 具有不同 配置摘要，不能删除该身份以强行匹配。"
msgstr "When explicitly referencing an original candidate or stage record, verify its real source, configuration, artifacts and execution scope. Historical source, configuration mismatch, missing originals and invalid records cannot become passes for this iteration. SDK byte identity, actual consumption and complete software candidates are also separate scopes. SDK resolution using manifest inputs may have a different configuration digest from a checkout; do not remove that identity to force a match."

msgid "物理 HIL 当前为 `not_executed`，查询不会改变 `physical_qualified=false`。 PCB、供电、跳线、波形、吞吐与时序需要真实 station 原件，软件模型和预算不提供 这些物理结论。资格规则见[验收边界](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)。"
msgstr "Physical HIL is currently `not_executed`; queries do not change `physical_qualified=false`. PCB, power, jumpers, waveforms, throughput and timing need actual station originals. Software models and budgets provide none of these physical conclusions. See the [acceptance boundaries](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)."

